  "project_id": "audio_multimodal",
  "reasoning": "Grounded findings: incident fact: Yuki and Theo report that the player never loads; Omar and Jun report that audio will not play in LT. Each asks about QN and recalls a possible previous-queue workaround. | incident fact: Omar also reports that the waveform loads but pressing Play never starts sound. | guidance: Report unavailable playback as a tool incident with the task ID and reproduction details, including browser/error state and whether another clip plays. A waveform without playback is not proof of silence. Leave unavailable content quality unassessed; do not assign a model-quality failure or content QN solely because playback is unavailable. Retain any separate accessible content concern for review. | guidance: Check an old workaround against current symptoms rather than inferring an attempted or failed fix from recurrence. The thread requests task IDs, a reproduction attempt, error state and time; if another clip plays, retain both task references. | history: The approved, posted batch-05 diagnostic trial allowed at most one reload through August 28. The later completed-trial record reports playback starting in two of six attempts and remaining stuck in four. Its conclusion was that the trial did not provide a dependable general workaround, and the time-limited authorization was not extended into a later queue. The review did not establish a common cause. | inference: Current handling and the prior trial outcome are established, but neither establishes repair or a common cause for these incidents. The reporters' references to recurrence do not establish that they attempted the earlier workaround or that it failed on their tasks. Resolution (MIXED) from grounded per-member states: PARTIALLY_RESOLVED x2, UNRESOLVED x2. Agent 1 recorded (attributed input, not evidence): PARTIALLY_RESOLVED x1, UNRESOLVED x3; 2 of 4 unverified (Agent 1 NEEDS_REVIEW). Withheld as not established by cited evidence (see diagnostics): announcement:k:slack:C_AUDIO_ANNOUNCEMENTS:1790890099.000112:64d38d33.",
  "recommended_action": {
   "action_type": "POST_ALIGNMENT",
   "draft_text": "For batch 06, report LT playback that never loads or starts—including a visible waveform without playback—as a tool incident. Include the task ID, browser/error state, time, reproduction details and whether another clip plays; retain both task references if a comparison clip plays. Leave unavailable content quality unassessed. Do not assign a model-quality failure or choose content QN solely because playback is unavailable; retain any separate accessible content concern for review (c3–c4). The earlier batch-05 one-reload trial restored playback in two of six attempts, was not dependable and was not extended into a later queue. Do not present it as an authorized batch-06 workaround or confirmed repair (c5). Recurrence does not show that these reporters attempted or failed that workaround, and this handling note does not establish restored playback (c6).",
   "scope_note": "Post current handling and the historical clarification together. No documentation defect is established by the supplied current guidance. Technical diagnosis and individual recovery are not prerequisites for this alignment (c3–c6)."
  },
